<title>BRAZIL: Brazil to drop export tax on sugar, derivatives.</title>
<headline>Brazil to drop export tax on sugar, derivatives.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian government will eliminate an export tax on sugar and its derivatives, the Central Bank said Friday.</p>
<p>A Central Bank decree due to be released later Friday would detail the change, a spokesman for the bank said.</p>
<p>He was unable to say when the exemption would take effect but said most Central Bank decrees came into effect on their publication.  </p>
<p>&quot;The export tax on sugar and derivatives will be zero,&quot; the spokesman said.</p>
<p>(( -- William Schomberg, Brasilia newsroom 5561 3141193))</p>
</text>
